OL,3,GNEWSARoad changes proposed after
OL,4,A'concerning' incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FChanges to a road's layout in Reading
OL,7,Fare being proposed to cut the number of
OL,8,Faccidents following a series of
OL,9,F"concerning" incidents over recent
OL,10,Fmonths.
OL,12,FReading Borough Council said it had
OL,13,Freceived reports of issues with
OL,14,Fpedestrian crossings and left hand
OL,15,Fturns onto the outbound bus lane in
OL,16,FKing's Road.
OL,18,FIt wants to break up the bus lane at
OL,19,Fthree junctions ` into Reading College,
OL,20,FKingsgate Street and Rupert Street ` to
OL,21,Fgive drivers more time to look out for
OL,22,Fother vehicles.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
