OL,3,GNEWSARoad changes proposed after
OL,4,A'concerning' incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plan is set to be approved by the
OL,7,Fauthority's traffic management
OL,8,Fsub-committee next Thursday, but would
OL,9,Fbe subject to public consultation
OL,10,Fbefore being introduced.
